                menu.open && menu.items.first().is_some_and(|item| item.label == first)
            })
            .await;
            cx.update_window(handle, |_, window, cx| window.press("enter", cx))
                .unwrap();
            cx.wait_for(handle, TIMEOUT, |_, cx| editor.read(cx).value() == expected)
                .await;
        }
    }

